Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Back to School 2026",
  "startDate": "2026-08-01",
  "endDate": "2026-09-15",
  "description": "Special discounts on laptops and tablets for students."
}

###

### 7.3 POST - Enroll a customer in a campaign
POST http://localhost:4004/admin/CustomerCampaigns
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ID": "cc111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "customer_customerID": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
  "campaign_campaignID": "c1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}


